    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> added to hot water,&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f871cf71-2160-4f97-887f-fdf0586564c4-ed09eacc-f2af-4159-82b3-d6dcf7194d01-ce117026-f239-4d9f-ab92-f4ead34eb900-image.png\" style=\"width: 247px; height: 70px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> is added to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KI</mi></math>,&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/69844817-e584-4c02-847e-a8648856e519-6c58a644-135b-4f7d-adc5-316564256e7b-5d1f7c1c-f6de-42a6-a0f3-820a4f4ecc20-image.png\" style=\"width: 354px; height: 70px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Kl</mi></math> is added to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>,&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/485c1447-1e80-431b-b9d9-1305979369e2-aef35db5-521b-4c7d-a906-fd6a760fd855-4966b658-fc7d-47e8-a9c4-7f59165b9bd2-image.png\" style=\"width: 383px; height: 69px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> in water&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Al</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Al</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;positively charged&nbsp;</p>",
